description	"Jedi Traditionalist

A master who eschews dueling prowess for strong Force powers and excellent defense against blasters.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Red/Cyan)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (3)
-- 42% less Red/8% more Cyan damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (3)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (3)
- Protect (2) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block/Focus (1)"
